      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.17,
      "end_seconds": 7.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.89,
      "end_seconds": 18.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "so the thing is, I've got periods becoming irregular"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.3,
      "end_seconds": 22.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
