      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.66,
      "end_seconds": 34.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.64,
      "end_seconds": 54.52,
      "duration_seconds": 6.88,
      "text": "Okay: temp 37.0 degrees, heart rate 75, saturation 98 percent, pressure 124 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.37,
      "end_seconds": 56.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.29,
      "end_seconds": 66.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment. Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.12,
      "end_seconds": 81.23,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "It's moderate, honestly. I've also had mood swings, for about two weeks. About mood swings, it's severe, honestly. I've had poor sleep too, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.26,
      "end_seconds": 85.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "how strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.13,
      "end_seconds": 88.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "I'd call it moderate"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.77,
      "end_seconds": 95.61,
      "duration_seconds": 5.84,
      "text": "Have you had periods becoming irregular before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.96,
      "end_seconds": 106.38,
      "duration_seconds": 9.42,
      "text": "yes, um, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 116.52,
      "end_seconds": 120.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "did you get very heavy bleeding, weight loss or pelvic pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.73,
      "end_seconds": 127.91,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "no, no very heavy bleeding, weight loss or pelvic pain"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.01,
      "end_seconds": 135.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "How about bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.07,
      "end_seconds": 139.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "nope, no bleeding after sex"
